    "detailed_description": "You are a courier in the furniture delivery service.<br />\r\nYesterday you drove a chair to Tomato Street, and today - a mirror on Lenin Avenue.<br />\r\nAnd again the car broke down - which means that all the daily earnings will go to repair.<br />\r\nThe only thing that will brighten up these working days is music. Every week a single track is added to the radio in the rotation. What will be a hit in February? And in October?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA realistic courier simulator - every day is similar to the previous one. Routine. Only addresses and cargo for delivery differ. Everything, as in life.<br />\r\nMinimalistic text interface. Get a check-list with assignments for each day and execute them for income.<br />\r\nA random list of cases for each game day - a lot of combinations of subject-address, there will be almost no repetitions.<br />\r\nMusic written by a neural network is a unique soundtrack for every game week. But you can choose manually in the settings you like the melody, and it will not interrupt during the game.",
